  description: 'Activate this card if both players have 5 or more monsters in their
    GYs; destroy as many monsters on the field as possible, then each player banishes
    (face-down) all monsters from their Deck, then you can Special Summon 1 Normal
    Monster from your GY. Once per turn, during the Standby Phase: Activate this
    effect; each player can Special Summon 1 monster from their GY, ignoring its
    Summoning conditions, but banish it when it leaves the field. You can only activate
    1 "Underworld Circle" per Duel.'
